GLM-OCR family: third-party notices

1. Image resampling

The antialiased bicubic resize of 8-bit images in runtime/image.cpp (filter,
index ranges, int16 weights, rounding and pass order) reproduces the CPU kernel
that torchvision uses, adapted from PyTorch v2.9.1,
aten/src/ATen/native/cpu/UpSampleKernel.cpp:
https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/v2.9.1/aten/src/ATen/native/cpu/UpSampleKernel.cpp
