2. Processor, prompt and positions

smart_resize, the normalization and merge-window patch order in
runtime/image.cpp, the chat-template rendering in runtime/prompt.cpp and the
multimodal rotary positions (get_rope_index) follow Hugging Face Transformers
v5.22.2 (models/glm46v/image_processing_glm46v.py,
models/glm46v/processing_glm46v.py, models/glm_ocr/modeling_glm_ocr.py) and the
chat template of the zai-org/GLM-OCR checkpoint:
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers
Copyright The HuggingFace Inc. team.
Licensed under Apache License 2.0.

3. Tokenizer

runtime/tokenizer.cpp implements the Split pre-tokenizer, byte-level BPE (with
ignore_merges) and added-token handling of the Hugging Face tokenizers library
for the checkpoint's tokenizer.json:
https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers
Copyright The HuggingFace Inc. team.
Licensed under Apache License 2.0.

4. Unicode data

runtime/unicode_tables.h is generated from the Unicode Character Database 16.0
(UnicodeData.txt); its license is in UNICODE_LICENSE.txt.
